    "detailed_description": "Visciple29er is a face tracking application that uses face detection technology.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt operates as a pseudo controller and can be used as a XInput  general purpose device.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt tells the pseudo controller the yaw, pitch, roll, distance, lean, and estimated gaze coordinates from the face position.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAssignment:<br />\r\nYaw: Right analog stick X<br />\r\nPitch: Right analog stick Y<br />\r\nRoll: Analog trigger LR<br />\r\nDistance: Left analog stick Y<br />\r\nLean: Left analog stick X<br />\r\nPupil\uff1aHAT switch<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFAQ<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQ:  This application network communication?<br />\r\nA:  It works without network communication.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQ:  What kind of webcam do you recommend?<br />\r\nA:  Recommend a camera with Pan/ Tilt/ Zoom (PTZ) .",
